cal phenomenon (approved), during the last 24 months_ Renewed F\u00edsic phenomenon in installations of the same owner: The following faults have occurred during the same installation, physical phenomena in the affected installation: This installation has not been affected on an occasion by a similar physical phenomenon (approved), during the last 24 months_ Similar phenomena_ Renewed F\u00edsico in installations of the same owner: The following faults have occurred during the same installation, physical","es":"Estudio para an\u00e1lisis de falla EAF 507/2025\n\u201cDesconexi\u00f3n forzada de la barra 23 kV N\u00b01 de S/E Pozo Almonte\u201d\nFecha de Emisi\u00f3n: 12-12-2025\n1. Descripci\u00f3n pormenorizada de la perturbaci\u00f3n\na. Fecha y Hora de la falla\nFecha 20/11/2025\nHora 07:01\nConsumos desconectados (MW) 7.75\nDemanda previa del sistema (MW) 9691.53\nPorcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n 0.080 %\nCalificaci\u00f3n Apag\u00f3n No aplica (porcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n < 10%)\nb. Identificaci\u00f3n instalaci\u00f3n afectada\nNombre de la instalaci\u00f3n Barra 23 kV N\u00b01 de S/E Pozo Almonte / BA50G0216SE123G0216\nTipo de instalaci\u00f3n Barra\nTensi\u00f3n nominal 23 kV\nSegmento Transmisi\u00f3n zonal\nPropietario instalaci\u00f3n afectada Engie Energ\u00eda Chile S.A.\nRUT 88.006.900-4\nRepresentante Legal Gabriel Marcuz\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Isidora Goyenechea N\u00b02800, Piso 16, Comuna Las Condes, Santiago.\nc. Identificaci\u00f3n del elemento fallado\nSistema de protecci\u00f3n Pa\u00f1o CT3 de S/E Pozo Almonte (Siemens 7UT613) /\nNombre del elemento fallado\nSP0212G0216SE123G0216\nPropietario elemento fallado Engie Energ\u00eda Chile S.A.\nRUT 88.006.900-4\nRepresentante Legal Gabriel Marcuz\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Isidora Goyenechea N\u00b02800, Piso 16, Comuna Las Condes, Santiago.\nd.1 Origen y causa de la falla\nSe produjo la apertura autom\u00e1tica de los interruptores 52CT3 y 52E1 de S/E Pozo Almonte,\ncorrespondientes a los pa\u00f1os de barra 23 kV N\u00b01 y del alimentador Pampino de dicha subestaci\u00f3n,\nrespectivamente, por medio de la operaci\u00f3n err\u00e1tica de su l\u00f3gica adaptativa.\nPrevio a este evento, el interruptor 52E2 de la S/E Pozo Almonte se encontraba abierto por operaci\u00f3n\nde su protecci\u00f3n de sobrecorriente temporizada residual, 51N, por falla en este alimentador de origen\ndesconocido.\nd.2 Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico:\nOPE26: Falla en sistema de protecci\u00f3n o control. (*)\n(*) Fen\u00f3meno f\u00edsico determinado por el an\u00e1lisis propio del Coordinador, en","shown_language":"en","word_scores":[{"w":"study","s":-0.04},{"w":"fault","s":-0.07},{"w":"eaf","s":-0.03},{"w":"2025","s":-0.18},{"w":"forced","s":0.22},{"w":"disconnection","s":-0.02},{"w":"bar","s":1.0},{"w":"23","s":0.08},{"w":"kv","s":-0.04},{"w":"description","s":-0.03},{"w":"time","s":0.02},{"w":"failure","s":-0.08},{"w":"20","s":-0.07},{"w":"11","s":0.21},{"w":"2025","s":-0.18},{"w":"time","s":0.02},{"w":"07","s":0.02},{"w":"01","s":-0.03},{"w":"consumption","s":-0.03},{"w":"mw","s":0.08},{"w":"mw","s":0.08},{"w":"percentage","s":-0.02},{"w":"disconnection","s":-0.02}]},"predictions":{"conflux":{"pred":"busbar_fault","display_pred":"BUSBAR FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.2965,"breaker_fault":0.0343,"transformer_fault":0.029,"busbar_fault":0.6402},"confidence":0.6402,"correct":false},"quorum":{"pred":"line_fault","display_pred":"LINE FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.4784,"breaker_fault":0.0838,"transformer_fault":0.1007,"busbar_fault":0.3371},"confidence":0.4784,"correct":true},"nexus":{"pred":"line_fault","display_pred":"LINE FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.4592,"breaker_fault":0.1593,"transformer_fault":0.1487,"busbar_fault":0.2328},"confidence":0.4592,"correct":true}},"explanations":{"conflux":{"method":"Exact Shapley (Modality) + Gradient Attribution (Within-Modality)","contrib":{"D":{"share":0.2146,"signed":-0.1467},"T":{"share":0.0922,"signed":0.063},"R":{"share":0.6932,"signed":0.4738}},"domi